  Add <suppress> blocks here to silence specific CVEs that are accepted-risk
  or false positives. Each block must include a justification and an expiry
  date so suppressions don't accumulate forever.

  Example:
    <suppress until="2026-12-31Z">
       <notes>
          False positive: CVE only affects standalone redis-server binary,
          not the Java client we use.
       </notes>
       <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/io\.lettuce/lettuce-core@.*$</packageUrl>
       <cve>CVE-2024-XXXXX</cve>
    </suppress>

  Docs: https://jeremylong.github.io/DependencyCheck/general/suppression.html
-->
